/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/P 40 0 R
/T (Olympic data is large and spread across many files, Games and countries. Without one consolidated view, it is hard to see which sports, countries and regions perform best, how medals relate to sports investment, and where medals are won most efficiently. Three stakeholders need tailored answers:)
/E (Olympic data is large and spread across many files, Games and countries. Without one consolidated view, it is hard to see which sports, countries and regions perform best, how medals relate to sports investment, and where medals are won most efficiently. Three stakeholders need tailored answers:)
