/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/P 40 0 R
/T (The Olympic Games bring together many countries, sports and athletes, and the data from them is large and spread across many Games. This project analyses four project datasets \(athletes, medal results, Games summary and all-time country rankings\) covering 18 Olympic Games from 1992 to 2026, 60 countries, 50 sports and 7 regions. The data is presented through two interactive Tableau dashboards, a Tableau story and a Flask website.)
/E (The Olympic Games bring together many countries, sports and athletes, and the data from them is large and spread across many Games. This project analyses four project datasets \(athletes, medal results, Games summary and all-time country rankings\) covering 18 Olympic Games from 1992 to 2026, 60 countries, 50 sports and 7 regions. The data is presented through two interactive Tableau dashboards, a Tableau story and a Flask website.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [8]
>>
